{
  "$doc": "\u00a723.6 ST-5 (\u00a723.6g). Bands: ResolutionBands.Default (400 m + 200 m lead, forced 300 m, merge beyond band + lead + 200 m = 800 m, F-23). The posts are UnitSplits.FallbackPosts (D-P5): D-P3 plans a SQUAD's posts (UnitPostPlanningSystem, echelon 0), so a platoon gets no PlannedPosts, the manager does not wait, and 'sensible positions' = the fallback rows round the unit. A rifle platoon (type 305) has no vehicles - the 'soldiers and vehicles' half of the Judge line is not exercised. The children are addressed by NAME, <platoon>/<composite slot> (F-22, R-8349), listed in `later`. No resolution policy: the default merge line lies past the trigger (F-23), so the old mergeMargin 250 workaround (R-8336) is gone (R-8350).",
